*OpenUI *Resolution/Print Quality & Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/Level 5 - Fast Draft (300x300 dpi): "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsCompression 5>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/Level 3 - Standard (600x600 dpi): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsCompression 3>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 601dpi/Level 2 - High Quality (600x600 Multi-Pass): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsCompression 2>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/Level 1 - Ultra Fine Photo (1200x1200 dpi): "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]/cupsCompression 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
