*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale (Pigment Black / Composite): "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *CNBorderlessExtension/Borderless Amount of Extension: PickOne
